#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:2
msgid "COMPILE_OPTIONS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:6
msgid "List of additional options to pass to the compiler."
msgstr "要傳遞給編譯器的額外選項清單。"

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:8
msgid ""
"This property holds a :ref:`semicolon-separated list <CMake Language Lists>` "
"of options and will be added to the list of compile flags when this source "
"file builds.  The options will be added after target-wide options."
msgstr ""
"此屬性包含一個 :ref:`分號分隔的清單 <CMake Language Lists>` 選項，並在建置此"
"來源檔案時新增到編譯旗標清單中。這些選項將在目標範圍的選項之後新增。"

#: ../../../include/GENEX_NOTE_PER_SOURCE.rst:2
msgid ""
"Contents of |genex_subject| may use :manual:`generator expressions <cmake-"
"generator-expressions(7)>` with the syntax ``$<...>``.  However, :generator:"
"`Xcode` does not support per-config per-source settings, so expressions that "
"depend on the build configuration are not allowed with that generator."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:15
msgid "Usage example:"
msgstr "使用範例："

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:17
msgid ""
"set_source_files_properties(foo.cpp PROPERTIES COMPILE_OPTIONS \"-Wno-unused-"
"parameter;-Wno-missing-field-initializer\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:21
msgid "Related properties:"
msgstr "相關屬性："

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:23
msgid "Prefer this property over :prop_sf:`COMPILE_FLAGS`."
msgstr "建議優先使用此屬性而非 :prop_sf:`COMPILE_FLAGS`。"

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:24
msgid ""
"Use :prop_sf:`COMPILE_DEFINITIONS` to pass additional preprocessor "
"definitions."
msgstr "使用 :prop_sf:`COMPILE_DEFINITIONS` 傳遞額外的預處理器定義。"

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:25
msgid ""
"Use :prop_sf:`INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES` to pass additional include directories."
msgstr "使用 :prop_sf:`INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES` 傳遞額外的包含目錄。"

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:27
msgid "Related commands:"
msgstr "相關命令："

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:29
msgid ":command:`add_compile_options` for directory-wide settings"
msgstr ":command:`add_compile_options` 用於目錄範圍的設定"

#: ../../../prop_sf/COMPILE_OPTIONS.rst:30
msgid ":command:`target_compile_options` for target-specific settings"
msgstr ":command:`target_compile_options` 用於目標特定的設定"

